ue, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "81292737", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037649682", "personaname": "-CML-Daemonslayer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/CMLDaemonslayer/", "num_games_owned": 330, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 7286, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1810, "last_played": 1761875129, "avatar": "536bf78be093f0dd9a3fbb03b092a71ccfa9c134"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game so far, enemies are at least vaguely challenging in the later stages of normal mode, the expert mode you unlock after beating normal once gives enemies more abilities and more shield/health and they do more damage for an even larger challenge.\n\nA great game to play with friends both casually and seriously, as you can combine elemental affects and builds on the characters using both the upgrades and sharing of scrolls to accomplish some pretty cool things.\n\nMy only complaint at this point is that the final boss fight is so different from any of the others, the bosses so far are pretty much just \"shoot this and try not to get shot until either you or it dies\"(of course if you various weapons or skills it is much easier than without), however the final boss has actual stages and things you need to do to make it attackable, so is fairly strange compared to the rest but definitely a good challenge.", "timestamp_created": 1606776751, "timestamp_updated": 1606776751, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.527326464653015137", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "81291775", "author": {"steamid": "76561198131902519", "personaname": "blurplecat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steam